    {
      "id": "conservation-uniqueness-overview",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          109,
          80,
          195,
          955,
          435
        ]
      ],
      "en": "We have now discussed several selection criteria and noted some of the relationships between them. Our stated goal was to achieve some sort of uniqueness result. After all this work, are we in a position to do this? The answer, in general, is \"no.\" Although the criteria we have suggested rule out the most obvious \"physically unreasonable\" weak solutions, the question of existence and uniqueness is, in general, open. At the time of this writing, this is a very active area of research. In the following, we summarize a number of results in special cases.",
      "zh": "现已讨论了几种选择准则, 并指出它们之间的一些关系. 原先的目标是得到某种唯一性结果. 做过这些工作之后, 是否已能做到这一点? 一般而言, 答案是\"不能\". 虽然所提出的准则排除了最明显的\"物理上不合理\"的弱解, 但一般的存在性与唯一性问题仍是未解决的. 在撰写本书时, 这是一个十分活跃的研究领域. 下文概述一些特殊情形的结果.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 109,
          "printed_page": 99,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            77.96058117498421,
            381.7677811550152,
            173.91206569804172
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-03-batch-10/conservation-uniqueness-overview-109.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0109.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [],
      "source_review": "agent-reviewed",
      "confidence": "high",
      "cross_reference_integration": "pending full target availability"
    },
    {
      "id": "conservation-special-uniqueness-results",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          109,
          80,
          440,
          955,
          635
        ]
      ],
      "en": "For the scalar conservation law with strongly convex $f$, the questions of existence and uniqueness are basically settled. For genuinely nonlinear systems, existence (but not uniqueness) is known for initial data of small total variation. For the $p$ system, assuming strong convexity, much more is known. Solutions exist for arbitrary initial data, and uniqueness has been shown within the class of piecewise smooth solutions. We refer to~\\cite{Sm} for an exposition.",
      "zh": "对具有强凸 $f$ 的标量守恒律, 存在性与唯一性问题已基本解决. 对真正非线性的方程组, 已知对全变差较小的初始数据存在解 (但尚未知唯一性). 对 $p$ 方程组, 假设强凸性时, 已知结果多得多. 任意初始数据都存在解, 且已在分片光滑解类中证明了唯一性. 相关论述参见~\\cite{Sm}.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 109,
          "printed_page": 99,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            175.91105495893873,
            381.7677811550152,
            253.87163613392292
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-03-batch-10/conservation-special-uniqueness-results-109.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0109.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [
        "math:conservation-special-uniqueness-results:001",
        "math:conservation-special-uniqueness-results:002"
      ],
      "source_review": "agent-reviewed",
      "confidence": "high",
      "cross_reference_integration": "pending full target availability"
    },
    {
      "id": "conservation-other-results-and-limits",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          109,
          80,
          640,
          955,
          1000
        ]
      ],
      "en": "There are many specialized results for other systems, e.g., those where genuine nonlinearity is violated in a specific fashion and for the system of gas dynamics. Existence results are usually based on finding estimates for approximated solutions and extracting convergent subsequences. Such approximate solutions usually come from finite difference schemes or, alternatively, from adding \"viscosity\" terms to the equations. Some of the main contributors to the field are Lax, Glimm, DiPerna, Tartar, Godunov, Liu, Smoller and Oleinik. Despite all of these efforts, general answers in this field have remained elusive. In fact, there are recent counterexamples where the usual admissibility conditions do not guarantee uniqueness~\\cite{Se}. Of course, real world problems are usually in more than one space dimension. Almost everything is open for that situation.",
      "zh": "对其他方程组, 也有许多专门的结果, 例如以特定方式违背真正非线性的方程组, 以及气体动力学方程组. 存在性结果通常基于对近似解建立估计, 再提取收敛子列. 这类近似解通常来自有限差分格式, 或者来自向方程中添加\"黏性\"项. 这一领域的一些主要贡献者是 Lax, Glimm, DiPerna, Tartar, Godunov, Liu, Smoller 和 Oleinik. 尽管作出了所有这些努力, 这一领域的一般答案仍难以获得. 事实上, 近来已有反例表明, 通常的容许性条件不能保证唯一性~\\cite{Se}. 当然, 现实问题通常具有不止一个空间维度. 在这种情形下, 几乎所有问题都尚未解决.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 109,
          "printed_page": 99,
          "bbox": [
